"2026-11-09T00:05:11Z"}],"body":"# HyperFrames v0.9.26\n\nReleased on 2026-11-08.\n\nCloud renders now find media whose file names have accents, even when macOS stores the name differently from the page. A large project's first history copy is also much faster.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **CLI:** Cloud render finds media whose file name is stored in another Unicode form than the page's ([91ad7fb6e](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/91ad7fb6ee3fb4d0098385abdea64a1d5acd0dfd), [#7419](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7419)).\n\n## Performance\n\n- **Studio Server:** A large project's first history copy takes a fraction of the time ([2927fe615](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/2927fe615581f03258205a876fada7d6f3111dc8), [#7415](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7415)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.9.25...v0.9.26\n"}
